Download"}]}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"What is PlanBot?"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["PlanBot is an ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"AI-powered daily planner app"}]," that uses advanced language models to generate personalized daily schedules. Instead of manually creating to-do lists, you describe your goals to the AI, and it creates an optimized plan with time blocks, priorities, breaks, and activity sequencing."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["The app combines AI planning with ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"gamification"}]," (streaks, XP, levels) to keep you consistently engaged with your goals."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"children":"Core Features Review"}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"🤖 AI Plan Generation — ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"This is PlanBot's killer feature. The natural language interface is intuitive — you simply type what you want to achieve, and the AI creates a structured daily plan."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Example input:"}]," ",["$","em",null,{"children":"\"I have a physics exam in 5 days, need to finish a coding project by Friday, and want to workout 3 times this week. I'm free from 9 AM to 10 PM.\""}]]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"AI output:"}]," A complete daily plan with study blocks, coding sessions, workout slots, meals, and breaks — all time-blocked and prioritized."]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"What we love:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Multiple AI tiers to choose from (Basic → Standard → Advanced → Premium progression)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Plans are genuinely personalized, not generic templates"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Regeneration is seamless when plans change"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Natural language understanding is excellent"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"What could improve:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Limited to 2 plans/day on the free tier"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"No real-time calendar sync yet"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"🔥 Streak System — ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"The streak system is deceptively simple but incredibly effective. Every day you complete your plan, your streak grows. Miss a day, it resets."}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"What makes it great:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Visible streak counter creates real psychological stakes"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Streak freeze prevents total loss from one missed day"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Loss aversion kicks in after 10+ days (you CANNOT break it)"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Weekly and monthly streak milestones feel genuinely rewarding"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"This is the #1 retention feature in PlanBot. Users who build a 7-day streak have extremely high retention rates."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"📊 Weekly AI Reports — ⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Available on Elite and God tiers, weekly reports analyze your performance:"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Tasks completed vs. planned"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Subject/goal distribution"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Consistency patterns"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"AI-generated improvement suggestions"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"What we love:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Data-driven insights, not vague motivational quotes"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Trend analysis shows improvement over time"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Specific, actionable suggestions"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":["$","strong",null,{"children":"What could improve:"}]}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Only available on higher tiers"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"No export to PDF option yet"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"🎮 XP & Leveling System — ⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Complete tasks to earn XP, accumulate XP to level up. Simple RPG-style progression."}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Different tasks award different XP amounts"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Level milestones feel satisfying"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Provides an additional motivation layer alongside streaks"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"👤 Goal Personas — ⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Selecting a persona (Student, Professional, Athlete, Entrepreneur) adjusts how the AI generates plans:"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Student:"}]," Focuses on study blocks, revision, exam prep"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Professional:"}]," Includes deep work, meetings, upskilling"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Athlete:"}]," Integrates training, recovery, nutrition"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Entrepreneur:"}]," Balances strategy, execution, health, networking"]}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"Personas are a smart way to personalize the AI without complex configuration."}],"\n",["$","h3",null,{"children":"⚡ Boost Packs — ⭐⭐⭐"}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"One-time purchasable add-ons:"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Extra AI plans"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Streak freeze charges"}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Premium themes"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"These provide monetization flexibility without subscription pressure. Good for users who want occasional upgrades witho